@startuml file-own-paperwork
title Automation proposes, Beth approves

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Source system" as SRC
participant "Sidecar" as SC
participant "Contract #2ce4\nin design tool" as K
actor "Beth\n(owner)" as BETH
participant "Marketplace" as MP

SRC -> SC : schema change detected\n(new column)
SC -> K : read current contract
SC -> SC : draft diff,\nsuggest semver bump
SC -> BETH : propose v1.3.0\n(clean diff + changelog)

alt approved
  BETH -> MP : publish v1.3.0
  MP --> SC : OORS: registered
else rejected / edited
  BETH -> SC : revise or discard
end

note over SC, MP
  Data product drafts the change. 
  Human approves   the irreversible.
end note
@enduml